{
  "name": "ExpertsDDT web - contact + free libraries",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Web leads (expertsddt.com)\nUN solo webhook recibe los dos formularios de la web. El campo `source` decide la rama:\n- `contact` -> correo a Polanco@expertsddt.com\n- `exocad-libraries` -> fila en Google Sheets, pestaña Libraries (name, email, version, lang, page)\n- `ddt-xchange` -> fila en Google Sheets, pestaña DDT Xchange (email, lang, page)\n\nPASOS: 1) conectar credenciales de Gmail/SMTP y Google Sheets. 2) elegir el documento y la hoja. 3) activar el workflow. 4) copiar la **Production URL** del webhook a la variable de GitHub `PUBLIC_N8N_FORM_WEBHOOK`.\nCORS: el webhook solo acepta el origen `https://expertsddt.com` (Options > Allowed Origins). Plantilla sin probar: importar y comprobar con un POST de prueba.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "expertsddt-web",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "https://expertsddt.com"
        }
      },
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        260
      ],
      "webhookId": "expertsddt-web"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.source }}",
                    "rightValue": "contact",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "contact"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.source }}",
                    "rightValue": "exocad-libraries",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "libraries"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.source }}",
                    "rightValue": "ddt-xchange",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "ddt-xchange"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Por source",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        240,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "",
        "toEmail": "Polanco@expertsddt.com",
        "subject": "={{ 'Website inquiry from ' + $json.body.name }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "={{ 'Name: ' + $json.body.name + '\\nEmail: ' + $json.body.email + '\\nClinic: ' + ($json.body.clinic || '-') + '\\nLanguage: ' + $json.body.lang + '\\nPage: ' + $json.body.page + '\\n\\n' + $json.body.message }}",
        "options": {
          "replyTo": "={{ $json.body.email }}"
        }
      },
      "name": "Correo a Experts DDT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Libraries",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "date": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "name": "={{ $json.body.name }}",
            "email": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
            "version": "={{ $json.body.version }}",
            "lang": "={{ $json.body.lang }}",
            "page": "={{ $json.body.page }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Fila en Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        520,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: true } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Responder OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        800,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "DDT Xchange",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "date": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "email": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
            "lang": "={{ $json.body.lang }}",
            "page": "={{ $json.body.page }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Fila DDT Xchange",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        520,
        560
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Por source",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Por source": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Correo a Experts DDT",
